{
 "title": "Chapter 4: The Empire That Won and Fell Behind",
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Chapter 4: The Empire That Won and Fell Behind",
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "s05b01",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In 1762, a *German-born* princess seized the throne from her husband.",
     "shot": "c4_coup",
     "date": 1762,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:throne",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b02",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "She became Catherine the *Great*.",
     "shot": "c4_catherine",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "drum",
       "w:Catherine",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b03",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Under her, Russia pushed *west* and south.",
     "shot": "map:catherine",
     "date": 1772
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b04",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "It joined Prussia and Austria in carving up *Poland*.",
     "shot": "map:catherine",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "scribble",
       "w:carving",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b05",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "In 1783, it annexed *Crimea*, giving it a hold on the Black Sea.",
     "shot": "map:catherine",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:Crimea",
       0.5
      ]
     ],
     "date": 1783
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b06",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Russian settlers had also crossed the Pacific into *Alaska*.",
     "shot": "map:alaska",
     "date": 1799,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:Alaska",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b07",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "But it was too far and too *expensive* to defend.",
     "shot": "map:alaska"
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b08",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "So in 1867, Russia sold it to the United States for *$7.2* million.",
     "shot": "c4_sale",
     "date": 1867,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "kaching",
       "w:million",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b09",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Roughly *two* cents an acre.",
     "shot": "c4_sale",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "boing",
       "w:acre",
       0.5
      ]
     ],
     "gag": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s05i01",
     "text": "Now watch *closely*.",
     "shot": "in_spot",
     "type": "STORY",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "whoosh",
       0,
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s05i02",
     "text": "Europe's greatest general is about to make a *mistake*…",
     "shot": "in_spot",
     "type": "STORY"
    },
    {
     "id": "s05i03",
     "text": "and someone else will make the *exact* same mistake a hundred and twenty-nine years later.",
     "shot": "in_spot",
     "type": "STORY",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ticks",
       "w:hundred",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s05i04",
     "text": "See if you can *spot* it.",
     "shot": "in_spot",
     "type": "STORY",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:spot",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b10",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Then, in June 1812, *Napoleon* invaded with one of the largest armies Europe had ever seen.",
     "shot": "c4_napoleon",
     "date": 1812,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "drum",
       "w:invaded",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b11",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "He wanted one *decisive* battle.",
     "shot": "c4_napoleon",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:battle",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b12",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Russia *refused* to give him one.",
     "shot": "c4_napoleon",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "boing",
       "w:refused",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b13",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Instead, its armies retreated, *burning* crops and supplies as they went.",
     "shot": "c4_scorched",
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b14",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Napoleon marched *deeper* into a land that offered him nothing.",
     "shot": "map:napoleon"
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b15",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "He reached Moscow in September to find it nearly *empty*.",
     "shot": "c4_moscow1812",
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b16",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Then *burning*.",
     "shot": "c4_moscow1812",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "rumble",
       "w:burning",
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b17",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "He waited for a surrender that *never* came, and eventually turned back.",
     "shot": "c4_waiting",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ticks",
       "w:waited",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b18",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The winter hurt, but it wasn't the *main* killer.",
     "shot": "c4_retreat",
     "quiet": true,
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b19",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Distance, hunger, disease, and Russian attacks had already *shredded* his army.",
     "shot": "c4_causes",
     "quiet": true,
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b20",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Only a small *fraction* of it made it home.",
     "shot": "c4_causes",
     "quiet": true,
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b21",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Two years later, Russian troops marched into *Paris*.",
     "shot": "c4_paris",
     "date": 1814,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "drum",
       "w:marched",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b22",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "But here's the *cruel* twist.",
     "shot": "c4_twist"
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b23",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "While Russia was winning wars, the rest of Europe was building *factories* and railways.",
     "shot": "c4_split",
     "date": 1840,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "whoosh",
       "w:railways",
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b24",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Russia still relied on millions of *serfs*.",
     "shot": "c4_split"
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b25",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Its *defeat* in the Crimean War in the 1850s exposed how far behind it had slipped.",
     "shot": "c4_crimea",
     "date": 1855,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "w:defeat",
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "amb": "waves"
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b26",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "In 1861, Tsar Alexander II *freed* about 23 million serfs.",
     "shot": "c4_emancipation",
     "date": 1861,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "clang",
       "w:freed",
       0.45
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b27",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "But freedom *didn't* mean prosperity.",
     "shot": "c4_debt"
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b28",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Many freed peasants ended up in *debt* and poverty.",
     "shot": "c4_debt",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "paper",
       "w:debt",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b29",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "And in 1881, revolutionaries *assassinated* the Tsar with a bomb.",
     "shot": "c4_1881",
     "date": 1881,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b30",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Still, the empire *pushed* on.",
     "shot": "c4_train",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "whoosh",
       0,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b31",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "In 1891, it began the *Trans-Siberian* Railway.",
     "shot": "map:railway",
     "date": 1891
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b32",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Over *9,000* kilometres of track, from Moscow to the Pacific.",
     "shot": "map:railway",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:Pacific",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b33",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "A *steel* thread stitched across the country Russia had conquered.",
     "shot": "map:railway",
     "date": 1916
    },
    {
     "id": "s05b34",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "But the railway *couldn't* save the Romanovs.",
     "shot": "c4_romanovs",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "w:Romanovs",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}